 ┌ w3b ───────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
 │w3b keys  (? toggles this)                              │
 │  j / k          down, up        gg / G      top, bottom│
 │  h / l          left, right     0 ^ $       line edges │
 │  Ctrl-d / Ctrl-u  half page     PgDn/PgUp   full page  │
